### Get Company by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/company/1

### Get all Companys
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/company

### Lookup Companys
GET https://localhost:5001/api/biller/company/lookup

### Create Company
POST https://localhost:5001/api/biller/company
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "Name": "Sample",
  "BillingContactID": 0,
  "Registration": "Sample",
  "Address": "Sample",
  "AddressCity": "Sample",
  "AddressCode": "Sample",
  "AddressCountry": "Sample",
  "Phone": "Sample",
  "LogoImageID": 0,
  "Active": "Sample",
  "BillingContact": "Sample",
  "LogoImage": "Sample"
}

